  "description": "A .NET library for reading, modifying, and saving password-encrypted Excel files. Built on NPOI with support for both reading encrypted files and saving with encryption using Excel automation. Supports .xlsx, .xlsm (macro-enabled), and .xls formats. Perfect for applications that need to process secure Excel files while maintaining encryption. Supports .NET Standard 2.0, .NET 6.0, .NET 8.0, and .NET 9.0.",
  "id": "JFToolkit.EncryptedExcel",
